# Per-element callee with multiple outputs — refused (deferred flank)

A single-output callee lowers to a scalar-returning FunctionDef and a bare
Invoke. The multi-output form (the ratified design's FieldAccess on a
StructLiteral result) has no clingo closed-body image yet — a closed-body
field-access-over-Invoke is outside clingo's grammar (S15) — so `KamerMulti`,
which declares two outputs, is refused per element as a documented flank
(besluit 1-A, 2026-08-24).

```catala
declaration scope KamerMulti:
  input grondslag content integer
  output bedrag content integer
  output korting content integer

scope KamerMulti:
  definition bedrag equals grondslag + 100
  definition korting equals grondslag + 5

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslagen content list of integer
  output totaal content integer

scope Aanslag:
  definition totaal equals
    combine all b
      among (map each g among grondslagen to (output of KamerMulti with { -- grondslag: g }).bedrag)
      in acc initially 0 with (acc + b)
```
